{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36863","headline":"酬寄右司李员外 · 罗隐","name":"酬寄右司李员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"当年忆见桂枝春，自此清途未四旬。\n左省望高推健笔，右曹官重得名人。\n闲摛丽藻嫌秋兴，静猎遗编笑过秦。\n犹把随和向泥滓，应怜疎散任天真。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36863.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36863","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}